msgstr "Blok: \"Pari - Igra spomina\""

#. translators: 1: number of published cards, 2: of which special, 3: pairs needed for the hardest board
#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:306
#, php-format
msgid "Published cards: %1$d (%2$d special). The hardest board needs %3$d."
msgstr "Objavljenih kartic: %1$d (od tega %2$d posebnih). Najtežja plošča jih potrebuje %3$d."

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:312
msgid "Manage cards"
msgstr "Upravljaj kartice"

#. translators: %d: number of built-in cards
#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:318
#, php-format
msgid "Until then the built-in deck (%d cards) tops up the board."
msgstr "Do takrat ploščo dopolni vgrajeni komplet (%d kartic)."

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:323
msgid "The built-in deck is off, so some difficulties cannot start."
msgstr "Vgrajeni komplet je izklopljen, zato nekaterih težavnosti ni mogoče zagnati."

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:367
msgid "Brand line"
msgstr "Naslovna vrstica"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:367
msgid "Small header text above the game. Defaults to the site title."
msgstr "Kratko besedilo nad igro. Privzeto naslov spletnega mesta."

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:368
msgid "Intro eyebrow"
msgstr "Nadnaslov uvoda"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:368
msgid "Short label above the intro title. Leave empty for the default."
msgstr "Kratka oznaka nad uvodnim naslovom. Prazno pomeni privzeto."

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:369
msgid "Intro title"
msgstr "Uvodni naslov"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:372
msgid "Intro text"
msgstr "Uvodno besedilo"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:379
msgid "Leaderboard title"
msgstr "Naslov lestvice"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:380
msgid "Max name length"
msgstr "Največja dolžina imena"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:380
msgid "Characters allowed in the player name on the leaderboard."
msgstr "Dovoljeno število znakov v imenu igralca na lestvici."

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:381
msgid "Name when left blank"
msgstr "Ime, če ostane prazno"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:382
msgid "Dedicated page"
msgstr "Namenska stran"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:382
msgid "Create and maintain a page for the game at the address below"
msgstr "Ustvari in vzdržuj stran z igro na spodnjem naslovu"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:382
msgid "The plugin keeps a page at this slug and renames it when the slug changes. It never renames a page it did not create. Turn this off if you only use the shortcode or block."
msgstr "Vtičnik vzdržuje stran na tem naslovu in jo preimenuje, če naslov spremenite. Nikoli ne preimenuje strani, ki je ni ustvaril sam. Izklopite, če uporabljate samo kratko kodo ali blok."

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:385
msgid "Page slug"
msgstr "Naslov strani"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:393
msgid "Exit URL"
msgstr "Povratni naslov"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:393
msgid "Where the \"back to site\" button (shown on phones in full-screen mode) leads. Empty means the home page."
msgstr "Kam vodi gumb \"Na stran\" (prikazan na telefonih v celozaslonskem načinu). Prazno pomeni domačo stran."

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:397
msgid "Pairs - Easy"
msgstr "Parov - Lahko"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:398
msgid "Pairs - Medium"
msgstr "Parov - Srednje"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:399
msgid "Pairs - Hard"
msgstr "Parov - Težko"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:399
msgid "Each difficulty has its own leaderboard. Changing a pair count keeps old scores in the same tier, so change it before the game goes live if you can."
msgstr "Vsaka težavnost ima svojo lestvico. Če spremenite število parov, stari rezultati ostanejo v isti težavnosti - po možnosti to spremenite, preden gre igra v živo."

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:400
#: blocks/game/index.js:29
msgid "Preselected difficulty"
msgstr "Vnaprej izbrana težavnost"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:401
msgid "Special cards per board"
msgstr "Posebnih kartic na ploščo"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:401
msgid "How many cards flagged \"special\" are guaranteed on every board (if that many exist). 0 = no guarantee, they appear at random like the rest."
msgstr "Koliko kartic, označenih kot \"posebne\", je zagotovljenih na vsaki plošči (če jih je toliko). 0 = brez zagotovila, pojavijo se naključno kot ostale."

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:402
msgid "Built-in deck"
msgstr "Vgrajeni komplet"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:402
msgid "Top up the board with the built-in animal cards when there are not enough of my own"
msgstr "Dopolni ploščo z vgrajenimi živalskimi karticami, kadar mojih ni dovolj"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:402
msgid "Once you have published enough cards for the hardest board, the built-in ones stop appearing by themselves."
msgstr "Ko objavite dovolj kartic za najtežjo ploščo, se vgrajene nehajo pojavljati same od sebe."

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:403
#: includes/class-pairsmg-assets.php:147
#: includes/class-pairsmg-settings.php:157
msgid "Leaderboard"
msgstr "Lestvica"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:403
msgid "Let players save their score with a name"
msgstr "Igralcem dovoli, da rezultat shranijo z imenom"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:403
msgid "Off: the game still shows the score, but nothing is stored."
msgstr "Izklopljeno: igra rezultat še vedno pokaže, a ničesar ne shrani."

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:404
msgid "Leaderboard entries shown"
msgstr "Prikazanih vnosov na lestvici"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:405
msgid "Sound"
msgstr "Zvok"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:405
msgid "Sound effects on by default (players can toggle)"
msgstr "Zvočni učinki privzeto vklopljeni (igralci jih lahko izklopijo)"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:406
msgid "Confetti"
msgstr "Konfeti"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:406
msgid "Confetti on a good result"
msgstr "Konfeti ob dobrem rezultatu"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:407
msgid "Full screen on phones"
msgstr "Celozaslonski način na telefonih"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:407
msgid "Pin the game over the whole viewport on small screens"
msgstr "Na majhnih zaslonih igro razpni čez celoten zaslon"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:407
msgid "Recommended for a game that is played at events from a QR code. Off: the game sits inside the page like any other block."
msgstr "Priporočeno za igro, ki se igra na dogodkih prek QR kode. Izklopljeno: igra je del strani kot kateri koli drug blok."

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:411
msgid "Provider"
msgstr "Ponudnik"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:411
msgid "Players solve one challenge per visit before the first game. Score submissions are always tied to a server-issued single-use token, so bot protection guards against automated play, not against score tampering (which is prevented regardless)."
msgstr "Igralci pred prvo igro enkrat na obisk rešijo preizkus. Oddaja rezultata je vedno vezana na strežniški enkratni žeton, zato zaščita pred boti preprečuje avtomatizirano igranje, ne ponarejanja rezultatov (to je preprečeno v vsakem primeru)."

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:412
msgid "Site key"
msgstr "Javni ključ (site key)"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:412
msgid "The public key rendered in the browser."
msgstr "Javni ključ, ki se uporabi v brskalniku."

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:415
msgid "Secret key"
msgstr "Skrivni ključ"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:422
msgid "A secret key is stored. Leave blank to keep it."
msgstr "Skrivni ključ je shranjen. Pustite prazno, da ga obdržite."

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:424
msgid "Never leaves the server."
msgstr "Nikoli ne zapusti strežnika."

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:431
msgid "Test mode"
msgstr "Testni način"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:431
msgid "Use the provider's official always-pass test keys"
msgstr "Uporabi uradne testne ključe ponudnika, ki vedno uspejo"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:431
msgid "For local and staging sites, where real keys will not validate. The server-side verification still runs. reCAPTCHA v3 has no test keys - in test mode it is skipped. Turn this off before going live."
msgstr "Za lokalna in testna okolja, kjer pravi ključi ne delujejo. Strežniško preverjanje se še vedno izvede. reCAPTCHA v3 nima testnih ključev - v testnem načinu se preskoči. Pred objavo v živo izklopite."

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:434
msgid "reCAPTCHA v3 score threshold"
msgstr "Prag ocene reCAPTCHA v3"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:438
msgid "Scores below this are rejected. Google suggests 0.5."
msgstr "Ocene pod tem pragom so zavrnjene. Google priporoča 0.5."

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:442
msgid "Privacy"
msgstr "Zasebnost"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:445
msgid "With a provider selected, the game page loads that provider's script and the verification token is sent to the provider's servers along with the visitor's IP address. Mention this in your privacy policy. With \"None\", no third-party requests are made."
msgstr "Ko je ponudnik izbran, stran z igro naloži njegovo skripto, žeton preverjanja pa se skupaj z IP naslovom obiskovalca pošlje na strežnike ponudnika. To omenite v politiki zasebnosti. Pri \"Brez\" ni nobenih zunanjih zahtev."

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:453
msgid "Theme"
msgstr "Tema"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:454
msgid "Light"
msgstr "Svetlo"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:455
msgid "Dark"
msgstr "Temno"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:456
msgid "Parchment (warm)"
msgstr "Pergament (toplo)"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:457
msgid "Custom colours"
msgstr "Barve po meri"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:458
msgid "Presets fill the colour fields; pick \"Custom\" to keep your own values."
msgstr "Prednastavitve izpolnijo barvna polja; izberite \"Po meri\", da obdržite svoje vrednosti."

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:459
msgid "Background"
msgstr "Ozadje"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:460
msgid "Panels"
msgstr "Plošče"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:461
msgid "Text"
msgstr "Besedilo"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:462
msgid "Accent / buttons"
msgstr "Poudarek / gumbi"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:463
msgid "Success (matched cards)"
msgstr "Uspeh (najdeni pari)"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:464
msgid "Card back"
msgstr "Hrbtna stran kartice"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:465
msgid "Card frame"
msgstr "Okvir kartice"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:466
msgid "Fonts"
msgstr "Pisave"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:467
msgid "Bundled (Rajdhani + Open Sans, served from this site)"
msgstr "Priložene (Rajdhani + Open Sans, strežene s te strani)"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:468
msgid "Inherit from the theme"
msgstr "Podeduj iz teme"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:470
msgid "Card shape"
msgstr "Oblika kartice"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:471
msgid "Portrait 7:10 (playing card)"
msgstr "Pokončna 7:10 (igralna karta)"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:472
msgid "Portrait 3:4"
msgstr "Pokončna 3:4"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:473
msgid "Square"
msgstr "Kvadratna"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:475
msgid "Corner radius (px)"
msgstr "Zaobljenost robov (px)"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:475
msgid "0 for square corners everywhere."
msgstr "0 za oglate robove povsod."

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:476
msgid "Card image fit"
msgstr "Prileganje slike na kartici"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:477
msgid "Inset - image centred with a margin (logos)"
msgstr "Vstavljeno - slika na sredini z robom (logotipi)"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:478
msgid "Full face - image fills the card (finished artwork)"
msgstr "Cela kartica - slika zapolni kartico (končna grafika)"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:479
msgid "Default for your cards; each card can override it."
msgstr "Privzeto za vaše kartice; vsaka kartica lahko to spremeni."

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:484
msgid "Card back image"
msgstr "Slika na hrbtni strani"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:490
msgid "Choose image"
msgstr "Izberi sliko"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:491
msgid "Remove"
msgstr "Odstrani"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:492
msgid "Optional. Drawn centred on the card back on top of the card back colour. A logo or emblem, ideally SVG or PNG with transparency."
msgstr "Izbirno. Narisana na sredini hrbtne strani čez barvo hrbta. Logotip ali znak, najbolje SVG ali PNG s prosojnostjo."

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:499
msgid "Verifications per IP per hour"
msgstr "Preverjanj na IP na uro"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:499
msgid "Each verification may cost an outbound request to the bot-protection provider. 0 disables the limit."
msgstr "Vsako preverjanje lahko pomeni zunanjo zahtevo do ponudnika zaščite. 0 izklopi omejitev."

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:500
msgid "Game starts per IP per hour"
msgstr "Začetkov igre na IP na uro"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:501
msgid "Scores saved per IP per hour"
msgstr "Shranjenih rezultatov na IP na uro"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:502
msgid "Reverse proxy / CDN"
msgstr "Posredniški strežnik / CDN"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:502
msgid "This site is behind Cloudflare or another proxy - read the visitor IP from CF-Connecting-IP / X-Forwarded-For"
msgstr "Ta stran je za Cloudflarom ali drugim posrednikom - IP obiskovalca beri iz CF-Connecting-IP / X-Forwarded-For"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:502
msgid "Only turn this on if the site really is behind a proxy, otherwise a visitor could forge the header and dodge the rate limits. IPs are only ever stored as a salted hash."
msgstr "Vklopite samo, če je stran res za posrednikom, sicer bi obiskovalec lahko ponaredil glavo in se izognil omejitvam. IP naslovi so vedno shranjeni le kot soljen izvleček."

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:503
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Odstranitev"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-admin-settings.php:503
msgid "Delete all plugin data (settings, scores, cards) when the plugin is deleted"
msgstr "Ob izbrisu vtičnika izbriši vse njegove podatke (nastavitve, rezultate, kartice)"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-assets.php:143
msgid "Verification"
msgstr "Preverjanje"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-assets.php:144
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "Priprava"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-assets.php:146
msgid "Result"
msgstr "Rezultat"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-assets.php:148
msgid "Verifying..."
msgstr "Preverjanje ..."

#: includes/class-pairsmg-assets.php:149
msgid "Verification failed. Please refresh the page and try again."
msgstr "Preverjanje ni uspelo. Osvežite stran in poskusite znova."

#: includes/class-pairsmg-assets.php:150
msgid "Please complete the verification first."
msgstr "Najprej dokončajte preverjanje."

#: includes/class-pairsmg-assets.php:151
msgid "Your session has expired. Please verify again."
msgstr "Seja je potekla. Prosimo, ponovite preverjanje."

#. translators: %d: number of pairs
#: includes/class-pairsmg-assets.php:153
#, php-format
msgid "%d pairs"
msgstr "%d parov"

#. translators: %d: number of cards
#: includes/class-pairsmg-assets.php:155
#, php-format
msgid "%d cards on the board"
msgstr "%d kartic na plošči"

#. translators: %d: best score
#: includes/class-pairsmg-assets.php:157
#, php-format
msgid "Best: %d"
msgstr "Najboljši: %d"

#: includes/class-pairsmg-assets.php:158
#: templates/game.php:50
msgid "Loading..."
msgstr "Nalaganje ..."

#: includes/class-pairsmg-assets.php:159
msgid "No scores for this difficulty yet - be the first."
msgstr "Za to težavnost še ni rezultatov - bodi prvi."

#: includes/class-pairsmg-assets.php:160
msgid "The leaderboard cannot be loaded right now."
msgstr "Lestvice trenutno ni mogoče naložiti."

#. translators: %d: number of results
#: includes/class-pairsmg-assets.php:165
